OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 29 MAY
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music for your morning,
OL,7,     Gwith discoveries and surprises
OL,8,     Grubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,9,     Gfavourites.
OL,10,G1300FClassical Live
OL,11,     GMark Forrest introdcues specially
OL,12,     Grecorded concert performances
OL,13,     Gfrom today's featured conductor,
OL,14,     GRiccardo Muti, including a great
OL,15,     Gchoral tour-de-force from Anton
OL,16,     GBruckner.
