OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 29 MAY
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Miles Davis 100 -
OL,5,     FMiles Beyond
OL,6,     GJournalist Kevin Legendre
OL,7,     Gexplores how Miles Davis
OL,8,     Gbroadened the jazz repertoire,
OL,9,     Gcovering pop hits in the 1980s.
OL,10,G2200FLate Junction
OL,11,     GVerity Sharp shares a remote
OL,12,     Gcollaboration session between
OL,13,     Gtrumpeter Laura Jurd and poet
OL,14,     GAnthony Joseph, celebrating the
OL,15,     Glegacy of jazz icon Miles Davis
OL,16,     Gon his centenary.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GSoweto presents music from a
OL,19,     Gselection of previously
OL,20,     Gunreleased recordings of Miles
OL,21,     GDavis live in concert, ranging
OL,22,     Gfrom the 1960s to 1980s.
